Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.83,0:01:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（汉斯顿公馆 1542年）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.51,0:12:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（苏格兰）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.64,0:01:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.94,0:01:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 玛丽女士 - 伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Mary. - Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.06,0:01:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你梳妆完毕了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you dressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.34,0:01:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还未 我在看书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not quite. I was reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来坐下 我有个喜讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and sit. I have some news.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.09,0:01:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 玛丽 是何喜讯 - 我刚听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mary, what is it? - I just heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.57,0:01:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据议会法案\N{\fnArial\fs30}By Act of Parliament you and I are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你我都恢复了继承权\N{\fnArial\fs30}both restored to the succession.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.48,0:01:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 是排在爱德华及其继承人之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Edward and his heirs, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定是国王主动提出\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King himself must have commanded this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不为此而高兴吗 伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you not pleased, Elizabeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.67,0:01:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想想这意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think what this means.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.79,0:01:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你若高兴 那我也高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are pleased then so am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.36,0:02:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这意味着 国王仍爱着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means that the King loves both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还意味着你也许某天会成为女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that you may be Queen some day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.92,0:02:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也一样 伊丽莎白女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you. Queen Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.66,0:02:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.12,0:02:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鉴于发生在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.97,0:02:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳王后身上的一切 我已下定决心\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Queen Katherine, I have made my mind up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.95,0:02:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么决心\N{\fnArial\fs30}In what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.19,0:02:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}As God is my witness,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.24,0:02:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将永不成婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall never marry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.91,0:02:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 罗马大使阁下到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, His Excellency the Imperial Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.25,0:02:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大使阁下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excellency. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下真是友好周到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty is most gracious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.25,0:03:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信陛下已经得知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure Your Majesty is aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.95,0:03:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我主罗马皇帝正与法兰西国王再度交战\N{\fnArial\fs30}my master, the Emperor, is once more at war with King Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法兰西国王厚颜无耻 竟与土耳其勾结\N{\fnArial\fs30}The French King's despicable alliance with the Turk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不仅危及罗马边境\N{\fnArial\fs30}threatens not only the borders of the Emperor's domains,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也威胁到了整个欧洲的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}but also the security of the whole of Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此\N{\fnArial\fs30}For that reason alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇帝陛下命我前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}his Imperial Majesty has asked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.09,0:03:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再度向陛下您伸出友谊之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}to offer the hand of friendship to Your Majesty once more,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.39,0:03:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请您与我们结盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}in joint alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.37,0:03:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}共克背信弃义的法兰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the perfidious French.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有何好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would I gain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您可收回所有失地\N{\fnArial\fs30}All your lost territories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.91,0:03:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外加整个阿基坦地区（法国西南部）\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole of Aquitaine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:03:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大使阁下 请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莱斯利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Risley!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.09,0:04:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大使阁下 陛下有请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法兰西大使阁下到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Excellency the French Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 马里亚克先生 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Monsieur Marillac. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听闻贵国正与罗马皇帝交战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear your country is at war… with the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.15,0:04:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确有此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝违背了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Emperor has broken all his promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.67,0:04:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当日对法兰西国王及陛下您\N{\fnArial\fs30}and treaty obligations,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所做的承诺 并违反了盟约\N{\fnArial\fs30}both to my master King Francis and to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马里亚克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Marillac,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:04:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当日你签署缔结条约时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you signed a treaty, your master agreed to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贵国国王曾答应为我国支付年恤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}an annual pension to this country,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但过去两年他都借口拖延\N{\fnArial\fs30}which he has defaulted on for the past two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 他至今已欠下了白银白万两\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a consequence, he now owes arrears of a million crowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 若果真如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, if that is true…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是在质疑我的话吗 马里亚克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You doubt my word, Monsieur Marillac?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会禀明国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty will be informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.43,0:05:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所欠款项定当随后送来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And redress will surely follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.46,0:05:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十多年来 我们两国的结盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alliance between our countries has kept.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直平衡着欧洲的势力\N{\fnArial\fs30}the balance of power in Europe for over ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今 面对罗马帝国的入侵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely Your Majesty would not care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}to compromise that arrangement now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}定无意破坏盟约吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the face of Imperial aggression?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马里亚克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Marillac.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.74,0:05:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你即刻修书一封 告诉苏格兰国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to write a letter to the King of the Scots.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我国邀请他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him that we invite him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.78,0:06:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}签署一份协议 明确我国的宗主权\N{\fnArial\fs30}to sign a treaty acknowledging our suzerainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.69,0:06:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并要求他立刻解除\N{\fnArial\fs30}over his country. Also to tell him to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.31,0:06:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与法国以及教皇的联盟 否则后果自负\N{\fnArial\fs30}his French and Papal alliances, or suffer the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.59,0:06:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 遵命 陛下 - 大人 你即刻前往苏格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - My Lord, I want you to prepare to go to Scotland.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.03,0:06:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确保我外甥接受这份协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case my cousin refuses to concede to our demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 遵命 陛下 - 带萨里同去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - And take Surrey with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的牌技真是精湛 李先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You play very well, Mr. Leigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.57,0:06:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此乃浪费生命的表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always the sign of a wasted life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:07:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你我身上的共同之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you and I have more in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.22,0:07:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}远比你想象得多 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}than you might imagine, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.80,0:07:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 愿闻其详 - 我们的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Our families.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都来自斯托克韦尔的圣玛丽教区\N{\fnArial\fs30}both come from St. Mary's parish in Stockwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教堂也是在同一年建立\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our chapels were founded in the same year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}泛泛之论 实难苟同 李先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hardly makes us equal, Mr. Leigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is another thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.76,0:07:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的家族与前皇后也沾亲带故\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you, my family was related to the late Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.44,0:07:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不觉得在宫廷里议论死者有失妥当吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not you think it unseemly to raise her ghost at court?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.09,0:07:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为有失妥当的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it unseemly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们霍华德见其行荒淫之事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you Howards turned a blind eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}竟然不闻不问 不管不顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}to her despicable wantonness,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.62,0:07:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}致使吾等受其牵连 败坏名声\N{\fnArial\fs30}which tarnished the reputations of all of us associated with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「你们霍华德」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You Howards!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.99,0:07:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你方才是这样说的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「你们霍华德」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You Howards"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.74,0:08:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要割下你的舌头 神定助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cut your tongue out, so help me God!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.08,0:08:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要割下你那该死的舌头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cut your fucking tongue out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.49,0:08:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉蒂默大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Latimer,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯·西摩爵士来访\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.10,0:08:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是托马斯爵士啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Sir Thomas,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能来真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}how good of you to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅 我身体不适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please… Please forgive my infirmities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如您所见 我状况欠佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, I am not a well man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.88,0:08:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信阁下很快就能恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust your Lordship will soon recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕我是难以康复如初了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am afraid my health is too far broken to be mended.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:09:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请允许我介绍我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Allow me to present my wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.58,0:09:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳·帕尔 来见过托马斯·西摩爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine Parr. Catherine, Sir Thomas Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.51,0:09:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉蒂默夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Latimer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.71,0:09:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐 托马斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Sit down, Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas, I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.46,0:09:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是否清楚我的个人经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you are aware of my personal history?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.95,0:09:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉蒂默是北部地区的古老家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Latimers are an old northern family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.87,0:09:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不幸的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, unfortunately, we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那次起兵造反 我们作为叛党被俘\N{\fnArial\fs30}caught up in the late Rebellion against His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特·阿斯克把我当做人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}I myself was taken hostage by Robert Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.53,0:09:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关押起来 百般羞辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sore constrained by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下令我拒绝向阿斯克认罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty demanded that I reject Aske which I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并前往伦敦归顺于他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and came to London to submit to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但叛国罪名犹如达摩克利斯之剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still I think the shadow of treason hangs over me and my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.45,0:09:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道国王对您信任有加\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you have the ear of the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望您替我在陛下面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like you to make submission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.38,0:10:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美言几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}on my behalf to His Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}转达我绝对的忠诚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}of my utter loyalty and… and…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别说了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.19,0:10:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}闭上眼睛休息片刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close your eyes and rest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:10:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是否有所察觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he suspects anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 没有 我敢肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Nothing. I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他将不久于人世 凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cannot be long for this world, Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 别说这样的话 - 我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hush! Don't say such things. - I only meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.64,0:11:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我等不及与你厮守 结为夫妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I cannot wait until we can be together, and married.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.57,0:11:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天地可鉴\N{\fnArial\fs30}As truly as God is God,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我万分期待与你结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I desire to marry you above all others.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里伯爵给陛下的议会写了封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Earl of Surrey has written a letter to Your Majesty's Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.24,0:11:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯爵目前关押在弗利特监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Earl is presently detained at the Fleet Prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}监狱 所为何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prison? What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据说他与李约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems he was in an affray.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在宫中发生争执\N{\fnArial\fs30}with one John Leigh within the verge of the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被警卫官逮捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was arrested by the Sergeant-at-Arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.17,0:11:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因何事争执\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the cause of the quarrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.54,0:11:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}必是言语之间折损了萨里伯爵的颜面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe it touched upon his Lordship's pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:12:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他在信中说什么 - 他要求立刻出狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does he write? - He demands his immediate release.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你有否答复 - 我们告诉伯爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you replied? - We informed his Lordship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.63,0:12:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此狂妄自大\N{\fnArial\fs30}that his lack of humility.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只能适得其反 难以如愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}would only impair his prospects of liberty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.69,0:12:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他凭什么认定该被释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why does he say he should be released?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.73,0:12:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他暗示萨里伯爵此等人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He infers that the Earl of Surrey has.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不应遭受这般待遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}no business being so treated in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.90,0:12:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还说不负陛下所托 必将全力讨贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also speaks of his readiness to serve Your Majesty on active duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我看来 全英格兰最傲慢的蠢货非他莫属\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he is the most foolish proud man in all of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.77,0:12:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他为日后行为支付高额担保 然后释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set a high surety on his future behaviour, but release him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.69,0:12:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要派他去苏格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him in Scotland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么苏格兰人的骄傲 见鬼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on with your Scottish pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.25,0:13:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里大人 这是三位被俘的贵族\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Surrey, here are three of their nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡西里斯大人 格兰凯恩大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}captured in battle: Lord Cassilis, Lord Glencairn,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和麦斯威尔大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Lord Maxwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.53,0:13:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们将依据身份与地位的不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will be treated with the honour and respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以礼相待\N{\fnArial\fs30}due to your rank and station.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以国王亨利八世之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the name of His Majesty, King Henry VIII,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.94,0:13:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我邀请诸位随我返回伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I invite you to return with us to London,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那里能得到最好的安置\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you will be most comfortably housed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.79,0:13:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 你们必须先弃剑投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, I must ask you to surrender your swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来照顾这些马匹 带些绳子来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with those horses and bring the rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人们 索维莫斯一战 我军大获全胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords, a great victory was had by us at Solway Moss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这全归功于赫福德大人和萨里大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to my Lord Hertford and to my Lord Surrey,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.51,0:13:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几位苏格兰贵族被俘\N{\fnArial\fs30}several Scottish nobles were captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.49,0:13:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今在此任凭我们处置\N{\fnArial\fs30}and are held here at our pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:14:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 诸位 还有更好的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that, my lords, is not the end to our good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.07,0:14:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两日之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Distracted by his grievous defeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苏格兰国王不堪惨败之痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}the King of the Scots took to his bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}暴毙而亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and died just two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同一日 他的妻子诞下唯一的子嗣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on that day, his wife gave birth to their only child.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.19,0:14:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却非能继承王位的麟儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was not the son and heir they had hoped for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.18,0:14:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是女婴\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.59,0:14:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 如此甚好 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. Excellent. - Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此乃天助我也\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should see it as an act of divine intervention,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苏格兰王位将落于年轻女子之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}this passing of the Scottish crown to a very young female.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 感谢上帝相助 - 诚心感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks be to God. - Thanks be to God, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那是自然 - 这会是个美满的圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Absolutely. - It shall be a very happy Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.02,0:14:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鉴于后位虚悬 我打算让玛丽公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the absence of a Queen I have asked the Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主持庆典\N{\fnArial\fs30}to preside over the festivities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时 王子将首次出席 履行职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, my son will be performing his first public duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.35,0:14:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都退下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.43,0:14:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 臣告退 - 臣告退\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.57,0:15:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯大人 有传言说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas. I was told you considered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.61,0:15:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为我对萨里伯爵的处罚过轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}my treatment of the Earl of Surrey far too lenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.28,0:15:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说对他的刑罚应当再重些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said he deserved a greater punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.25,0:15:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 臣以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么好想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What business do you have to think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若我是你 便不会再想\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were you I would not think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只怕深思会让我得出错误的结论\N{\fnArial\fs30}if thinking makes me come to the wrong conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.38,0:15:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 退下 - 臣告退\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out, Tom. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.40,0:15:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你看上去真美 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look beautiful. - My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.69,0:15:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝您圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I wish you a very happy Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 玛丽女士 - 凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Mary. - Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉蒂默大人近来如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is Lord Latimer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.11,0:15:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不太好 他还在病中 无法上朝\N{\fnArial\fs30}No better. He did not feel strong enough to come to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为他伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sad for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有你 我为你们两人祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for you. I pray for both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.74,0:16:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢您的关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.35,0:16:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会转达您的慰问之意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give him your good wishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 圣诞快乐 - 圣诞快乐 凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and Happy Christmas. - Happy Christmas, Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国大使阁下到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Excellency, the French Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.99,0:16:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.73,0:16:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enchanter!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直认为 你一定会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I persist in thinking you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.13,0:16:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奥尔良公爵完美的新娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}make a perfect bride for the Duke of Orleans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.09,0:16:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}承您美言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am honored that you think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.68,0:16:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会将他的画像呈给您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll send you his picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.85,0:16:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华王子和伊丽莎白女士驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince Edward and Lady Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华 爱德华 别那么心急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward! Edward! Don't be so impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.35,0:16:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫福德伯爵和伯爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Earl and Lady Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.88,0:16:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人们 请允许我向您们介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords, may I present His Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.88,0:16:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 爱德华王子 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Prince Edward. - My Lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.22,0:16:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 殿下 - 欢迎您们在圣诞节时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Grace. - You are most welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.13,0:16:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}造访我国\N{\fnArial\fs30}to His Majesty's court at this Christmas time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能得殿下亲自关怀 实乃幸事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace is very kind to speak to us in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.59,0:17:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我一直学着做呐 - 做得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have been practising. - Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 走吧 - 史考菲女士和戴维女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now come. - Lady Scofield. Lady Davit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 国王想向您提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords, the King has a proposal to put to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.02,0:17:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们两国应签订和平条约\N{\fnArial\fs30}There should be a peace treaty between our countries…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.67,0:17:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也该为爱德华王子及新晋\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a formal betrothal between Prince Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苏格兰的玛丽公主订立婚约\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the newly born Princess Mary of Scots.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.83,0:17:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}德文伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Earl of Devon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王也意识到可能遇到的困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King is not unaware of possible… difficulties.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.01,0:17:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 如果得到你们的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why, if you support the cause,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将会回以不菲的赏赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will be rewarded with a handsome pension.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也将被即可释放 返回苏格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will be released at once to return to Scotland.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.07,0:17:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想圣诞节之际\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure your families.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家人对各位定然甚是思念\N{\fnArial\fs30}are missing you greatly at this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.80,0:17:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将心比心 若让我和妻子分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how I should feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.55,0:17:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确痛苦非常\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I were separated from my own dear wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.75,0:17:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人 欢迎返回王庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace. Welcome back to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵夫人没和您同行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the Duchess not with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.95,0:18:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}内子随心而行\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Duchess does as she pleases.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们各自生活 互不干涉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We live mostly separate lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 我为您家庭和睦而祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very sorry. I… I will pray for your reconciliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}韦斯福德伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Earl of Wexford.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下安好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.40,0:18:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如你所料 他郁郁寡欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has been melancholy as you might have supposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.82,0:18:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他对寻找生活之乐已然绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he despairs of finding any happiness in this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.15,0:18:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但前几周他突然情绪高涨\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the last few weeks his mood has altogether changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.16,0:18:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, I cannot explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.16,0:18:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许有感于苏格兰大捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Triumph in Scotland, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公主 臣告退\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大人慢走 - 国王驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Grace. - His Majesty the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 圣诞快乐 - 祝陛下圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Merry Christmas. - Merry Christmas Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.71,0:19:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.85,0:19:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.51,0:20:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.97,0:20:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉蒂默夫人来向陛下请愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lady Latimer is come to petition Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.35,0:20:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恳请陛下撤销对其夫君拉蒂默大人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to lift the suspicion of treason from her husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 叛国之罪 - 她现在何处\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lord Latimer. - Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.15,0:20:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汤姆 这与你何干\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does any of this have to do with you, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.67,0:20:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回陛下 确与臣无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但臣乃其故友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except that I'm a friend of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信拉蒂默大人对陛下的忠心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in Lord Latimer's complete loyalty to Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.58,0:20:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得你是醉翁之意不在酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think your mind works another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另有目的 不 别急着否认\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to another purpose… No, no. Don't deny it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也怪不得你 她确实是位美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor can I blame you. She is still a very handsome woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.26,0:20:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马上就会成为富有的寡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and soon to be a very rich widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.39,0:20:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带她来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring her to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.07,0:21:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 见过陛下 - 汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 见过玛丽女士 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Mary. - My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.30,0:21:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向阁下致歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies, Your Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最近我未在朝中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have recently been away from court.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.22,0:21:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}未能参与国事 大使 恕我失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am not privy to the King. Ambassador, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵 朝中久未见您的身影\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been a long time absent from court, Your Grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.90,0:21:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过是打理我的产业去了 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to tend to my estates, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.84,0:21:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为你是对我避而不见呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rather thought you'd been careful of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.62,0:21:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以为我还在生你的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You imagine I'm still angry with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.67,0:21:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵 你多心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be too careful, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.73,0:21:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵疏离君王多日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is very remiss of you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.73,0:21:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实乃粗心之举啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}neglect your sovereign for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.05,0:21:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 臣明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.49,0:21:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 我想让你为我做点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I want you to do something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:21:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.22,0:22:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我要见你家主人 - 抱歉 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need to speak to your master. - Alas, Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.75,0:22:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我家主人此刻卧病在床\N{\fnArial\fs30}my master is in bed with gout.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.05,0:22:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正受通风折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in the greatest agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.10,0:22:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 务必请公爵进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Show His Grace in. By all means.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.18,0:22:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请公爵见谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace must forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.55,0:22:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无妨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.06,0:22:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我给你带来点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have brought something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请问上面所书何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask its import?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.27,0:22:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主要是我主之间秘密条约的相关事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It contains the outlines for a secret treaty between our masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.81,0:22:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于近来英国商船\N{\fnArial\fs30}The recent seizures of English merchant ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.92,0:22:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在法国港口遭到扣押\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the French ports.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.86,0:22:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及法王与土耳其\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the French King's new amity with the Turks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.42,0:22:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新盟友关系的最终解决方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the final straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.98,0:22:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利国王许诺 无论何时 只要汝皇有难\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Henry promises to support the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.60,0:22:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他必将鼎立相助\N{\fnArial\fs30}whenever he is called upon to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.89,0:22:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他同时承诺会与汝皇的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also pledges to invade France.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.67,0:22:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}联合进攻法国\N{\fnArial\fs30}in conjunction with the Emperor's armies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.57,0:23:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人的这份密函实比治愈我痛风之疾的药方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace could not have made.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.06,0:23:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更令在下欣喜不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}me happier if you had brought me a cure for gout!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.96,0:23:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会立即将此函呈递吾皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will make sure this is delivered to the Emperor immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.92,0:23:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我敢肯定他收到此函后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can be sure that he will receive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.16,0:23:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}定会非常高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the very greatest pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.56,0:23:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 拉蒂默女士到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, Lady Latimer is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.85,0:23:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 拉蒂默女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Lady Latimer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.35,0:23:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉蒂默女士 我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Latimer, I wanted to assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.08,0:23:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的丈夫并没有叛国嫌疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is no suspicion of treason against your husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.22,0:23:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更不用说你和你的家族了\N{\fnArial\fs30}still less against you and your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.70,0:23:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.21,0:24:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我十分清楚在这次北方叛乱期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know very well the cause of the distress to Lord Latimer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.44,0:24:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉蒂默亲王所遭劫难的缘由\N{\fnArial\fs30}during the late rebellion in the North.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.24,0:24:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也知道你和你的继子惨遭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also know that you and your stepchildren were.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.96,0:24:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叛党罗伯特·阿斯克一伙的虐待和凌辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}very roughly handled by the traitor Robert Aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.04,0:24:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那种经历一定令你惶恐万分 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have been very frightened, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.67,0:24:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 其实在当时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at the time, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.42,0:24:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更令我惶恐忧心的是 我的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was more frightened for my husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.92,0:24:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我担心他的安危和精神状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}for his safety and his sanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.02,0:24:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听闻拉蒂默大人近来体况欠佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear that Lord Latimer is unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.64,0:24:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已病入膏肓 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is very ill indeed, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.18,0:24:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕已经时日无多\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not likely to live long.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.33,0:24:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你俩尚无子嗣吗 - 没有 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have no children by him? - No, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.03,0:24:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与你第一任丈夫也没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor by your first husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.28,0:24:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.05,0:24:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我十七岁便嫁与伯勒大人之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was married at seventeen to Edward Borough,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.95,0:24:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华·伯勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the son of Lord Borough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.18,0:24:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是婚后三年 他便亡故\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he died three years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.79,0:25:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说他是精神失常 是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told he was insane. Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.33,0:25:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那确非一段完满的婚姻 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not a happy marriage, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.83,0:25:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那段岁月定然不堪回首吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think such a thing exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.85,0:25:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.17,0:25:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我依然竭心尽力地去面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe so with all my heart and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.79,0:25:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah… please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.20,0:25:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.47,0:25:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉蒂默女士 你这般乐观精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to be congratulated, Lady Latimer,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.78,0:25:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}着实值得赞佩\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your… eternal optimism.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.09,0:25:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.06,0:25:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下吩咐送此谕函 交您亲览\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty has sent these papers for your attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.03,0:25:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 莱斯利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr. Risley.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.73,0:25:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对了 莱斯利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Mr. Risley,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.13,0:25:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诚如你所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.16,0:26:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确信陛下已和伟大的天主教宗国\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the King has made a secret treaty with the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.19,0:26:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}签订了一份秘密条约\N{\fnArial\fs30}the great champion of Catholicism!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.73,0:26:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是为何没有看到陛下发令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as a result, I see no reason why we should not start.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.46,0:26:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}举国清剿路德会\N{\fnArial\fs30}hunting down all the Lutherans.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.66,0:26:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和新教徒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and evangelicals in His Majesty's Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.95,0:26:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您觉得他们近来活动很猖獗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think there are many such?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.20,0:26:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确信如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.74,0:26:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们衍续如鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}They breed like rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.84,0:26:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所到之处 尽其所能播散恶毒的异端邪说\N{\fnArial\fs30}They spread the vile disease of their heresy everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.74,0:26:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且就在当下 其中党羽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of them, even now,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.64,0:26:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已潜匿于君王之侧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}are very close to the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.27,0:26:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们应将其揪出并一举清除\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…we should flush them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.86,0:26:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.68,0:26:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并将他们活活烧死在肮脏的肉市之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And set them on the pyres at Smithfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.41,0:26:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你意下如何呢 莱斯利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you agree, Mr. Risley?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.29,0:27:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是包裹吗 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parcels, sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.51,0:27:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 从何而来 - 从国王那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who from? - From the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.52,0:27:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.07,0:27:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来自国王的包裹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parcels from the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.35,0:27:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不想打开看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well. Are you not going to open them?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.66,0:27:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好吧 - 打开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes… - Open them then.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.99,0:27:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.86,0:27:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}褶裥… 还有衣袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleats… and sleeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.56,0:27:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一些服装衣饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}For dresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.30,0:27:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me look.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.25,0:27:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 都是华贵的服饰吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are they fashionable? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.98,0:27:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王为何要送你礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should the King send you presents?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.19,0:27:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 我觉得我应该退还回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I think that I should return them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.31,0:27:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能退还国王的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot return presents to the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.90,0:28:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须收下并致谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must acknowledge them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.87,0:28:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我并不知道他为何要送我礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why he has sent them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.30,0:28:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes you do, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.05,0:28:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你心里清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.32,0:28:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我此刻已与行尸走肉无异\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel as though I am dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.29,0:28:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以吾仁慈的陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call upon His Gracious Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.15,0:28:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利八世之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Henry VIII,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.20,0:28:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于上帝及众位\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pledge before God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.20,0:28:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}证官近前宣誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}and these witnesses to honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.41,0:28:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恪守与神圣罗马帝国之皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}this new Treaty between His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.56,0:28:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查理五世陛下所签订的条约\N{\fnArial\fs30}and King Charles V, the Holy Roman Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.53,0:28:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此份条约 明确规定缔约双方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This treaty of mutual assurance contains.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.34,0:28:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在即日起两年之内 共同承担\N{\fnArial\fs30}within it an obligation to undertake a war against France.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.54,0:28:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对法国进战的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}within two years of this date,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.77,0:28:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为达成此项目标 吾王同意派遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}to which His Majesty agrees to send 40, 000 men-at-arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.50,0:29:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}40000名战士出征\N{\fnArial\fs30}for that purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.63,0:29:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.32,0:29:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是否愿意宣誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you pledge to honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.71,0:29:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恪守此条约内的全部条款\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the terms of this new treaty?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.27,0:29:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我愿意 愿上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, so help me God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.06,0:29:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 您是否愿意签署条约 - 我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will you sign the Treaty? - I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.88,0:29:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的部下终于能一览法国风光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally. Your men shall see France.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.03,0:30:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说来 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Excellency,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.29,0:30:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝是当真要与英王\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it true that a new treaty has been signed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.84,0:30:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}签订这项新条约吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}between His Majesty and the Emperor!?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.52,0:30:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我实在不理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.44,0:30:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仅仅为了诛伐一个基督教国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, but the design of subjugating Christendom,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.96,0:30:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就能令之前还对英王的戮袭 而仇怨满腔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}could make a revengeful prince like the Emperor forget the insult.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.46,0:30:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝 顷刻便与之冰释前嫌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}done to him by the King of England, in the person of his aunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.88,0:30:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既往不咎 马里亚克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those insults are long forgotten, Monsieur Marillac.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.79,0:30:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那您也不否认 您家主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't deny then, that your master plan is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.31,0:30:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是意在征服整个基督教界\N{\fnArial\fs30}to subjugate the whole of Christendom?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.36,0:30:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何出此言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.21,0:30:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那可是土耳其人的野心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe those ambitions are held by the Turks,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.17,0:30:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而您的主人却与他们为盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}with whom your own master is in alliance!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.17,0:30:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 公爵大人 - 阁下 请允许我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Grace. - Excellency! May I present you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.33,0:30:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向贵国发出正式的战事宣告\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a formal intimation of war against your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.18,0:31:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉蒂默女士到 托马斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Latimer is here, Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.49,0:31:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝啊 看看您\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.56,0:31:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您看上去真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look so very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.08,0:31:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.33,0:31:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这身华服乃是他人相赠\N{\fnArial\fs30}This dress was a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.27,0:31:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出自谁手\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gift? From whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.98,0:31:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.02,0:31:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王何时开始给您送礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did the King start sending you presents?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.38,0:31:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在最近 我并没有主动取悦于他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recently. I… I gave him no cause!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.07,0:31:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 当然不会 你怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Of course not. How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.43,0:31:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是相信我的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you do believe me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.04,0:31:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请告诉我 您相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please say that you believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.68,0:31:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.74,0:31:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从未想过从国王那儿得什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never sought these advances from the King,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.37,0:32:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且从未有此意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly do not welcome them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.50,0:32:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 你不想当英国的王后吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would not… like to be Queen of England?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.53,0:32:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 看在老天的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! For heavens' sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.17,0:32:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很清楚那些王后的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what happens to his Queens!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.95,0:32:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人人都清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone knows what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.25,0:32:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯 我害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas, I… I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.23,0:32:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.57,0:32:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不过是寂寞了 挑逗你而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just a lonely man that has set his cap at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.67,0:32:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.96,0:32:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下明鉴 苏格兰摄政王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty should know that the Regent Queen of Scotland.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.50,0:32:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已准许就她的女儿玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}has given permission for negotiations to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.92,0:32:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即未来的苏格兰女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}regarding a marriage contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.83,0:32:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与您的儿子 爱德华王子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}between her daughter Mary, soon to be Queen of Scots,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.49,0:32:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}婚约事宜进行商讨\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your son, Prince Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.84,0:32:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}协商完成后 双方将签署条约\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the negotiations are complete a treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.18,0:32:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英国与苏格兰的王座\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be signed, uniting through marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.99,0:32:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将由此姻缘而连接\N{\fnArial\fs30}the English and Scottish thrones.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.05,0:32:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一如陛下所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}as Your Majesty so desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.09,0:32:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来我们的苏格兰老爷们总算就犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems our noble Scottish lords did as we bid them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.90,0:33:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 一个襁褓中的女王 一群多嘴多舌的贵族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, with an infant Queen, a quarrelsome nobility,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.15,0:33:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又少了法国撑腰 苏格兰人已走投无路\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a lack of French support, what choice do the Scots have?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.68,0:33:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.41,0:33:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只希望您加紧完成协商\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only ask you to expedite negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.29,0:33:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}切勿错失良机\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not let this opportunity pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.91,0:33:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我始终不信任苏格兰人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't always trust the Scots.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.85,0:33:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 主教阁下 您有何事要奏 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Grace… you tabled an item? - Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.26,0:33:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很遗憾地告知您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret to have to inform you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.44,0:33:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在您近旁存有一伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we have discovered a nest of heretics.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.11,0:33:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宗教异端分子在活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the very heart of Your Majesty's household.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.79,0:33:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是说谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of whom do you speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.67,0:33:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王家礼拜堂的乐师们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The musicians of the Royal Chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.65,0:33:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.29,0:33:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唱诗班长官 约翰·玛贝克\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Master of Choristers, John Marbeck,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.78,0:33:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被指控是名秘密的加尔文教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}stands accused of being a secret Calvinist.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.06,0:33:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有风琴师罗伯特·特斯伍德以及埃德蒙·哈尔蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, the Organist, Robert Testwood and Edmund Harman,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.13,0:33:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那名歌手\N{\fnArial\fs30}a singing man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.46,0:33:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 您是否准许我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have Your Majesty's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.50,0:34:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逮捕并审问这几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to arrest and examine these men?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.24,0:34:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教阁下 我准许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace, I give you licence.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.41,0:34:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我决不允许在我身边出现任何新教徒或者叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have no evangelicals or traitors in this household.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.99,0:34:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于那些企图改变或意图推动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for those who wish to alter or push my Reformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.47,0:34:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的革新去向极端的人 我要告诫他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the extremes, I say this:
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.95,0:34:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要我还活着 绝不允许英国发生任何\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no alteration to the Church of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.78,0:34:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教会改革\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as I live!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.55,0:34:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰·玛贝克 罗伯特·特斯伍德\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Marbeck. Robert Testwood!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.67,0:34:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃德蒙·哈尔蒙 你们全都被捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edmund Harman! You are all under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.19,0:34:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seize him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.92,0:34:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特斯伍德先生 您不该来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should not have come here, Mr. Testwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.20,0:34:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 我还能去哪儿 求求您救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord… where else could I go? Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.72,0:34:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 求您了 - 我无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I beg of you. - There is nothing I can do,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.45,0:35:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能冒险暴露自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}without condemning myself, and that I will not do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.77,0:35:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您只需向加德纳告罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are only to be examined by Gardiner.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.07,0:35:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}按他的要求去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you answer him as he desires to be answered,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.12,0:35:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 您还有什么可怕的 - 我害怕 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- then what have you to fear? - I fear, my Lady, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.35,0:35:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为主教阁下又会诉诸其它教派\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Grace will then resort to other means of persuasion,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.54,0:35:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他现在正是这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}since that is the way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.66,0:35:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那您应坚定您的信仰 特斯伍德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you must be strong in your faith, Mr. Testwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.76,0:35:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}终有一天 我们都会走上耶稣之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know the day may come when we have to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.24,0:35:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但若我们心生恐惧 意念动摇\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the path of Christ. But if we are afraid, if we turn away,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.44,0:35:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就无权称自己为真正的基督徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we have no right to call ourselves true Christians.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.41,0:35:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您若胆敢提到我丈夫的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you so much as mention my husband's name,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.67,0:35:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向您保证 您家人的下场将十分凄惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you that things will go very badly with your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.57,0:35:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你美丽的妻子 还有那两个可爱的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sweet wife and those two lovely children.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.09,0:36:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听说您贵体欠安 玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}People tell me that you have been unwell, Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.37,0:36:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望不妨事了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust not too unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.65,0:36:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.52,0:36:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医师们给我放了一两次血\N{\fnArial\fs30}The surgeons have bled me once or twice,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.19,0:36:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想应该好些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so I think to be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.22,0:36:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 上帝保佑 - 是的 上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God willing. - Yes, God willing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.24,0:36:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.48,0:36:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我说说宫廷里的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what is happening in court.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.37,0:36:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王又打算再娶了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the King thinking of marrying again?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.61,0:36:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最近颁布了一条新法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a new law enacted.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.65,0:36:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}规定任何国王可能婚娶的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}It requires that any lady the King may marry must,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.69,0:36:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倘若受到任何对其行为不检的指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}on pain of death, disclose any charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.91,0:36:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将以死论处\N{\fnArial\fs30}of sexual misconduct that might be brought against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.05,0:36:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坦率的说 女士 这可大大缩小了范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly, my Lady, this rather narrows the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.70,0:36:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宫廷里的女士们 怎么说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ladies at court are… how to say…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.97,0:36:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}声誉都不太良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}not exactly known for their virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.46,0:36:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我仍然认为国王想要再娶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still think the King will want to remarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.98,0:36:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的确已有子嗣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is true he has a son,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.65,0:36:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他还需要更多儿子以妨不虞\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he will need another son to feel secure,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.47,0:37:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 以防长子不幸去世 - 您说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in case the first should die. - You are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.77,0:37:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个杀妻成性的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet… what woman on earth would want to marry a King.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.19,0:37:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有谁敢与其成婚呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}who either puts his wives away-or kills them?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.63,0:37:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特斯伍德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Testwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.96,0:37:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在您家中搜到的异端邪说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough heretical material was discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.73,0:37:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}足以指控您为\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your house to have you condemned.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.69,0:37:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}秘密的加尔文教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a secret Calvinist.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.91,0:37:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 倘若你肯配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, I would fain save you,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.13,0:37:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亦愿救你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you must help me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.54,0:37:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}掂量清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just think.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.06,0:37:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在这点痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pain you suffer now will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.98,0:37:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟火刑比起来根本不值一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}as nothing compared to the pains of the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.05,0:37:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你此刻所遭之苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all because you falsely, mistakenly, treacherously.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.39,0:37:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是因为你不识时务为上头的人遮掩\N{\fnArial\fs30}shelter those above you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.26,0:37:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何不告诉招出他们的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you will just confess to me their names.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.94,0:37:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.10,0:37:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一个叫菲利普·霍尔比的国王侍从\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is an usher of the King's, Sir Philip Holby.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.67,0:37:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否也是异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he one of your heretic circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.11,0:38:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不是 - 西蒙·海耶斯枢机主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Dr. Simon Heynes,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.11,0:38:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Dean of Exeter?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.34,0:38:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得你为他唱过颂歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sang for him once, I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.78,0:38:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是否也是秘密异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he another of your secret heretics?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.57,0:38:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫福德伯爵是否也参与此事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of the Earl of Hertford?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.84,0:38:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你若肯供出他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me the Earl of Hertford,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.00,0:38:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就饶你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will give you back your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.30,0:38:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下圣明\N{\fnArial\fs30}An excellent plan, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.33,0:38:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大人 - 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lord. - My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.39,0:38:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是诸多故事中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of all the hook stories,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.24,0:38:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我最喜欢的一个 您看呢 - 确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}- this is my favourite. Do you agree? - Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.17,0:38:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉蒂默夫人 大人近况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is your husband, Lady Latimer?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.95,0:38:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回陛下 还是卧床不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid he has taken to his bed, Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.21,0:38:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}近日他已立下遗嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lately made his will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.19,0:38:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我深表遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.94,0:38:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢陛下慷慨所赐衣物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must thank Your Majesty for this beautiful dress,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.55,0:38:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和丰厚礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your other generous gifts,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.38,0:38:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我实在受之有愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}of which I have done nothing to deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.87,0:39:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人整日愁眉紧锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You looked very sad, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.19,0:39:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我深知您近日处境艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure your recent life has been very difficult for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.87,0:39:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此赠予薄礼 宽慰汝心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to give you something to give you good cheer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.88,0:39:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以期博您一笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to see you smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.75,0:39:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此甚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.99,0:39:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们马上要和法国开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will soon be at war with France.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.03,0:39:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨福克公爵 您意下如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it, my Lord Suffolk?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.20,0:39:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 臣以为此事不宜操之过急\N{\fnArial\fs30}It cannot come soon enough for me, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.75,0:39:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正合我意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.46,0:39:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此战一旦打响 这将是我等\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it comes, the war will be a chance for us to exceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.69,0:39:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}超越先王亨利五世\N{\fnArial\fs30}even the glories of Henry V.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.67,0:39:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿金库尔战役的良机\N{\fnArial\fs30}at Agincourt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.22,0:39:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里大人 你有何高见\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, my Lord Surrey?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.76,0:39:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 微臣只求血洒疆场 勇立战功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, my kind always desires the honour of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.67,0:39:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能征伐法国更是求之不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what better field than France?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.05,0:39:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}附议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.91,0:39:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉蒂默夫人 你可会玩纸牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you play cards, Lady Latimer?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.20,0:39:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回陛下 略懂一二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.24,0:39:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.09,0:39:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王似乎很是倾心于拉蒂默夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King seems quite taken with Lady Latimer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.30,0:39:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所言极是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.96,0:40:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而据我们所知一旦国王迷上什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we know that when he takes a fancy to a person or a thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.20,0:40:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}定会不择手段得到为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}he usually goes the whole way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.41,0:40:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能正是如此他才会这样好兴致吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps that is why he's so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.89,0:40:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.11,0:40:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您可曾听说那些被抓的乐师们\N{\fnArial\fs30}have you heard what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.06,0:40:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to those musicians who were arrested?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.20,0:40:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加德纳提审了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gardiner examined them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.87,0:40:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而审讯结果不合他意\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was not satisfied with their answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.78,0:40:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以三个乐师都被收押伦敦塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all three have been transferred to the Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.99,0:40:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本官能否贸然问大人为何如此好奇此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask why Your Grace is curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.08,0:40:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 大人尽管问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. You may ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.05,0:40:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失陪一下 哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.10,0:40:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 您手气太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hand, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.81,0:40:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是给您的奖励\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.53,0:41:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 臣妾惶恐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.06,0:41:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 请收下 - 陛下 我万不能收\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please. - Your Majesty, I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.30,0:41:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打开看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.90,0:41:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.88,0:41:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}臣妾万分欣喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}although I am so touched,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.72,0:41:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感激不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}and flattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.99,0:41:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这枚戒指臣妾实在受之不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot accept this ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.76,0:41:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在寡人薄面 请务必收下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, accept this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.45,0:42:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢陛下隆恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.09,0:42:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必言谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.47,0:42:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.00,0:42:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我有美差派予你 - 陛下请讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have some very good news for you. - Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.80,0:42:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我责成你前往布鲁塞尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending you to Brussels,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.49,0:42:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永久出任我国驻荷兰摄政王府大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}on permanent embassy to the court of the Regent of the Netherlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.39,0:42:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯大人 你可愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it please you, Sir Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.19,0:42:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}微臣…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.19,0:42:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}微臣谢主隆恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very grateful to Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.60,0:42:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.85,0:43:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下是否在考虑再立新后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Your Majesty considering another marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.65,0:43:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.54,0:43:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 还要筹划对法大战 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And a war in France? - For certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.38,0:43:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下笃意再掀战火吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really want to fight again?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.86,0:43:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是 你不想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.27,0:43:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还以为你想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.39,0:43:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 还有再立新后 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And… take another wife? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.28,0:43:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正值壮年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I not still able?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.65,0:43:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再立新后再续龙脉重振雄风\N{\fnArial\fs30}To have a wife? To have more children?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.51,0:43:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有何不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.65,0:43:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿大人灵魂永安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Requiem aeternum dona es Domine,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.09,0:43:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并以灵光承照\N{\fnArial\fs30}et lux perpetua au luceat.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.57,0:43:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.44,0:44:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰 我有话对你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, I need to say something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.45,0:44:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.93,0:44:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不得好死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.57,0:44:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以圣父圣子圣灵的名义 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}In nomine Patris et Filii et Spiritus Sancti. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.11,0:45:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳·帕尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine Parr, we are sent here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.49,0:45:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鉴于您亡夫孝期已满\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the King's Majesty to offer you,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.00,0:45:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下遂命我等前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}after your days of mourning for your late husband are complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.44,0:45:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}代为提出求婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}his Majesty's hand in marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.46,0:45:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天下粉黛 陛下唯独对您宠幸有加\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty esteems you above all other women.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.90,0:45:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并期待您能接受陛下求婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}in his kingdom and hopes to find you well disposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.15,0:45:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此一来\N{\fnArial\fs30}towards his offer, in which case.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.01,0:45:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下与您必将成为\N{\fnArial\fs30}he will be the happiest man now alive in England,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.22,0:45:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰人人艳羡的神仙佳偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you the happiest woman.
